+real SPIR-V, during `loadMaterial()`/`reloadChanged()`. New public types
+(`src/rx_material/include/rx_material/instance.h`): `MaterialParamKind`
+(`Float`/`Float4`/`TextureIndex`/`Unsupported`, identical classification
